Do not fetch model pricing and context window data from the internet.

Why: at every boot with a cache older than 3 days the server fetches https://models.dev/api.json
(server/utils/helpers/modelPricing/index.js) and
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BerriAI/litellm/main/model_prices_and_context_window.json
(server/utils/AiProviders/modelMap/index.js), with no setting to turn either off. AskFiles
promises that no request leaves the machine. Both fetches now run only when
ANYTHING_LLM_ALLOW_REMOTE_MODEL_DATA=true. AskFiles uses Ollama, whose context window and
thinking capability come from the local /api/show, so neither file is needed.

Paths are relative to upstream/. Apply from the repository root with
  git apply --directory=upstream patches/006-no-boot-fetch.patch

